Hi,

Due to the rescheduling of the February PWG F2F meeting into
the second week of February (to avoid the Super Bowl mess for
travelers), we have moved the February OP call to the *first*
week of February:

Next OP US/Europe/Brazil Conference Calls:

(1) January 2016 - US/Europe/Brazil - OP Monthly Meeting
    - Note - NEW TIME starting in December 2015 - 2 hours earlier!
    - Note - NEW NUMBER in US started in November 2015

    - Tuesday 5 January 2015, Daytime
      - US
        9am in San Francisco - US PST (Pacific Standard Time)
        10am in Colorado - US MST (Mountain Standard Time)
        11am in Chicago - US CST (Central Standard Time)
        12pm in New York - US EST (Eastern Standard Time)
      - Europe
        6pm in Berlin - CET (Central Europe Time)
      - Brazil
        3pm in Belo Horizonte - BRST (Brasilia Summer Time)

    US:  +1 641-715-3814 - NEW NUMBER in US started in November 2015
    Germany:  +49 (0) 221 98203421
    Brazil:  +55 61 4040-4460
    Japan:  +81 (0) 3-5050-5070
    Participant Access Code:  622393#

    (note that local numbers for many other countries are available,
    also cellphone apps, VOIP support, etc. - please email Till for
    details)

